<title>JAPAN: Amway Japan -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Amway Japan -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 96.30		vs	  108.91</p>
<p> Operating	   20.85		vs	   29.80</p>
<p> Current	     21.02		vs	   28.36</p>
<p> Net		   13.62		vs	   14.40</p>
<p> EPS		   92.74 yen	  vs	   96.22 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    147 million	  vs	 150 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 50.00 yen	  vs	   75.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Amway Japan Ltd markets detergents and cosmetics and is affiliated with Amway of the United States.</p>
